If I wanted just individuals who are in the Maths or English department, I could do this as follows:


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
keep_depts <- c("Maths", "English")

df_eng_maths <- df_dept |>
  filter(Department %in% keep_depts)

gt(df_eng_maths)
```

